Adopt Ipê's prescriptive Live.app `init` signature.

Upstream Sky leaves `Live.app`'s `init` argument a free type variable and models
the request as an untyped `map[string]any`, so `init : {} -> ( Model, Cmd Msg )`
is accepted. Ipê pins the argument to the typed opaque `LiveReq` per app shape
(`Live.app` requires `init : LiveReq -> ( Model, Cmd Msg )`), a sanctioned
make-invalid-states-unrepresentable divergence recorded as B24 in
docs/divergences-from-sky.md and ADR 0021. A non-`LiveReq` init shape is a
fail-closed IPE-T0001, so the showcase adopts the `LiveReq` argument type. The
init body ignores the request, so the change is signature-only and the app is
otherwise unchanged.

--- a/src/Main.ipe
+++ b/src/Main.ipe
@@ -19,7 +19,7 @@
     | Edit String


-init : {  } -> ( Model, Cmd Msg )
+init : LiveReq -> ( Model, Cmd Msg )
 init _ =
     ( { count = 0 }, Cmd.none )
